    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e4a137b2ebb145c5816597107d97d3a6",
      "statement": "src/consents-signal.ts is a module-level pub/sub that translates 451 errors into a blocked flag. consentsOnError is passed as config.onError to RhAuthProvider and calls setBlocked(true) on any ApiError with status 451. subscribe(listener) registers callbacks; setBlocked and isBlocked manage the module-level boolean. This is the only place that distinguishes 'blocked by consents' from 'not signed in' because session restoration errors are absorbed by the provider.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/consents-signal.ts#L1-L49",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:821101b78579bb645993fda9cc35b9f1a95483a19ea60166f4c345302e856f88:"
