      "id": "claim_be78a2522f354768ae19308be41d8189",
      "statement": "ulabase.setup.consents.ts imports ulabase.setup.ts and appends four consents-gate documents (schema, permission, claims config, rule) as setup steps. Applying it to a service already configured with ulabase.setup.ts adds the gate and touches nothing else. The accounts steps must come first because the permission is written against the users collection that accounts owns.",
